[E0414] Error: cannot assign to `grid[…]` while a `match` binding refers to it
    ╭─[ err/336_slice_pattern_borrows/main.wip:11:13 ]
    │
  9 │     match grid {
    │           ──┬─  
    │             ╰─── matched here; the arm's bindings refer to it
    │ 
 11 │             grid[0] = 5
    │             ───┬───  
    │                ╰───── assigned here
    │ 
    │ Note: the bindings of a `match` on a place are aliases for its fields, so the place must not change until the arm ends
────╯
[E0405] Error: cannot move `a`, which is behind a reference
    ╭─[ err/336_slice_pattern_borrows/main.wip:18:26 ]
    │
 18 │     [a, ..] => take(move a)
    │                          ┬  
    │                          ╰── a `match` binding, which refers to part of the matched value
    │ 
    │ Help: to take the value apart, match it with `match move …`
    │ 
    │ Note: a reference can read a value but cannot take ownership of it
────╯
